     <tr><th>DPI Setting</th><th>Best For</th><th>Tradeoff</th></tr>
     <tr><td>Standard (72 DPI)</td><td>Web display, screen viewing, quick sharing</td><td>Smallest file size, but text and fine detail can look soft if viewed larger than screen size</td></tr>
     <tr><td>High (144 DPI)</td><td>General-purpose use — a solid default balancing quality and file size</td><td>Moderate file size increase over Standard</td></tr>
