   <p>A single converter that accepts any of the common formats and lets you pick any other as the output sidesteps the need to remember which specific tool handles which specific pairing. Upload once, choose your target format from a dropdown, done — regardless of whether you're going from JPG to PNG, PNG to WebP, GIF to JPG, or any other combination among the formats it supports.</p>
 
