   <h2>Free BMI Calculator — Metric & Imperial</h2>
   <p>Body Mass Index (BMI) is a widely used screening measure that estimates whether a person's weight is healthy relative to their height. This calculator computes your BMI instantly in either metric (kilograms and centimeters) or imperial (pounds and feet/inches) units, and shows which of the four standard WHO categories your result falls into: underweight, normal weight, overweight, or obese.</p>
 
