   <h2>Cron Expression Builder and Explainer</h2>
   <p>This tool helps you build and understand cron expressions — the standard syntax used by Unix-like systems (Linux, macOS) and many task schedulers to define when a recurring job should run. Adjust each field individually and see the generated expression update live, along with a plain-English explanation.</p>
 
