     <li><strong>*</strong> — matches every value (every minute, every hour, etc.)</li>
     <li><strong>*/N</strong> — matches every Nth value (e.g., */15 in minutes means every 15 minutes)</li>
     <li><strong>N-M</strong> — a range of values (e.g., 9-17 in hours means 9 AM to 5 PM)</li>
