     <li><strong>Nightly backups</strong> — running a database or file backup once a day during low-traffic hours, such as 0 2 * * * for 2 AM daily.</li>
     <li><strong>Periodic cache clearing</strong> — using an interval like */30 * * * * to clear a cache every 30 minutes.</li>
     <li><strong>Weekly reports</strong> — sending a summary email every Monday morning with an expression like 0 9 * * 1.</li>
