+    <ul>
       <li><strong>Missing commas</strong> between properties or array items.</li>
       <li><strong>Missing quotes</strong> around string values or object keys.</li>
       <li><strong>Extra trailing commas</strong> left after the last item in an object or array — valid in JavaScript object literals, but not in strict JSON.</li>
