   <p>All JSON processing happens locally in your browser using JavaScript's built-in JSON.parse() and JSON.stringify() functions — your data is never uploaded to a server or stored anywhere. This makes the tool safe to use with JSON containing API keys, internal configuration, or other sensitive structured data.</p>
