   <h2>How Much Loan Can You Afford?</h2>
   <p>This calculator estimates the maximum loan amount you can reasonably afford based on your monthly income, existing debt obligations, and a target EMI-to-income ratio — the reverse of a standard EMI calculation. Instead of asking "what will my EMI be for this loan amount," it asks "what's the largest loan I can take on while keeping my EMI within a safe percentage of my income."</p>
 
