   <h2>About the PDF Split Tool</h2>
   <p>The Logrith PDF Split tool lets you extract specific pages or split an entire PDF into individual page files, free and directly in your browser. Whether you need to pull a single chapter out of a long report, separate an invoice from a multi-page scanned batch, or break a document into one file per page, this tool handles it without needing Adobe Acrobat or any other desktop software installed.</p>
 
   <p>PDF splitting is one of the most common document tasks people run into — a scanned batch of receipts that needs separating into individual files, a textbook PDF where you only need one chapter, or a signed contract where you want to pull out just the signature page to send separately. This tool covers both the "extract specific pages" use case and the "split into one file per page" use case from the same interface.</p>
 
