   <p>Simple interest is the most straightforward way to calculate interest on a loan or investment: it's based only on the original principal amount, and stays constant every year regardless of how much interest has already accumulated. This calculator computes simple interest instantly and shows the underlying formula so you can see exactly how the result was reached.</p>
 
