     <li><strong>Compatibility</strong> — some platforms, email clients, and older software don't render SVG reliably, but virtually everything supports PNG.</li>
     <li><strong>Social media and thumbnails</strong> — many platforms require raster image uploads rather than vector files.</li>
     <li><strong>Favicon and app icon generation</strong> — raster PNG is typically the required input format for these workflows.</li>
