   <h2>How This Word Counter Calculates Each Statistic</h2>
   <p>Every number on this page updates live as you type, calculated using straightforward text-processing rules applied directly in your browser. Word count splits the text on whitespace and counts the resulting chunks. Character counts are measured both with and without spaces, since different platforms and style guides specify limits using either convention. Sentences are detected by counting sequences of text ending in a period, question mark, or exclamation point. Paragraphs are counted as blocks of text separated by a blank line. None of this requires a server round-trip — it all happens instantly using plain JavaScript string processing.</p>
 
